      "en": "Snooping, the MSI states and transitions, and a trace."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "stages[0..=3]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Then MESI's extra state, the same trace again, false sharing, and an exam question."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "stages[4..=7]"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "snoop",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 1: every cache sits on a shared bus. Every miss, every upgrade, every write-back goes out on it, and every cache sees it."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 1 of 8: snooping"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "stages"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "snoop"
      },
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "snoop[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Each cache controller watches, or snoops, the bus, and checks its own tags for the block being requested."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "snoop[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "With write invalidate, a cache must hold the only copy before it writes."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "snoop[2]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "To know what to do, each cache keeps a small state for every block it holds: two bits next to the tag."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "snoop[3]"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "snoop the bus · keep a state per block"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "states",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 2: MSI has three states."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 2 of 8: the MSI states"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "snoop"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "states"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Modified: this cache has the only copy, and has written it. Memory is stale, so if anyone else asks, this cache must supply the block."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "states[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Shared: this cache has a clean copy, and others may too. Memory is up to date."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "states[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Invalid: no usable copy here. A block that was never loaded counts as invalid too."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "states[2]"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "M: mine, dirty · S: clean, maybe shared · I: not here"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trans",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 3: the transitions. First, the ones caused by this cache's own processor."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 3 of 8: MSI transitions"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "states"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "tr"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Invalid, and my processor reads: put a BusRd on the bus, fetch the block, and go to Shared."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[0]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Invalid, and my processor writes: BusRdX, read exclusive. Fetch the block and invalidate everyone else's copy. Go to Modified."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Shared, and my processor writes: I already have the data, so just BusUpgr, an invalidation. Go to Modified."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[2]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Now the ones caused by other caches, seen on the bus. Shared, and someone else wants to write: go to Invalid."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[3]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Modified, and someone else reads: I have the only good copy. Write it back and supply it, and drop to Shared."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[4]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Modified, and someone else wants to write: write back, supply, and go to Invalid."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[5]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "And reads in S or M, or writes in M, are simply hits. No bus traffic."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "tr[6]"
      },
      {
       "action": "write",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "takeaway",
       "text": "reads need a copy · writes need the only copy"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "msi",
   "steps": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Stage 4: a trace. Three cores, one block X, six operations. All caches start Invalid."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "replace",
       "target": "head",
       "text": "Stage 4 of 8: an MSI trace"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "takeaway"
      },
      {
       "action": "hide",
       "target": "tr"
      },
      {
       "action": "show",
       "target": "tt"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "1: P1 reads X. A miss: BusRd, data from memory. P1 goes to Shared."
     },
     "do": [
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "tt[0][2]",
       "value": "S"
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "tt[0][3]",
       "value": "I",
       "delay": 0.1
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "tt[0][4]",
       "value": "I",
       "delay": 0.2
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "tt[0][5]",
       "value": "BusRd",
       "delay": 0.4
      },
      {
       "action": "set",
       "target": "tt[0][6]",
       "value": "memory",
       "delay": 0.5
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "2: P1 writes X. It is in Shared, so it must invalidate the others: BusUpgr, even though nobody else has a copy. P1 goes to Modified."
